{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52994","headline":"垂白之老击壤歌（题拟） · 李子卿","name":"垂白之老击壤歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功成作乐兮帝力则那，乐正崇德兮雅颂则多，云门之典兮大吕之歌，金石节奏兮丝竹骈罗，天地已正兮神人以和，两堦舞羽兮三边止戈，击壤鼓腹兮不识其他。\n客有献成功之颂，九重深兮其若何！（见《文苑英华》卷七四《功成作乐赋》附）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李子卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}